"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(30, 30, 30); position: relative;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/88Z0fMP8a88EpQWMCs1593G0ngu.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; object-fit: cover; color: transparent; transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\"><div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><div style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#000\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"margin-left: 2px;\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; padding-top: 2px;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px 0px 4px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;\">S1 E1 • 59m</p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 5px; line-height: 1.3; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Pilot</p><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); font-size: 12px; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.55; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">When an unassuming high school chemistry teacher discovers he has a rare form of lung cancer, he decides to team up with a former student and create a top of the line crystal meth in a used RV, to provide for his family once he is gone.</p></div></button><button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; background: none; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; transition: background 0.15s; box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(30, 30, 30); position: relative;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AbMoecO0ZZio0LcgeLxlzdyGs6X.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; object-fit: cover; color: transparent; transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\"></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; padding-top: 2px;\"><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px 0px 4px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;\">S1 E2 • 49m</p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 5px; line-height: 1.3; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Cat's in the Bag...</p><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); font-size: 12px; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.55; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Walt and Jesse attempt to tie up loose ends. The desperate situation gets more complicated with the flip of a coin. Walt's wife, Skyler, becomes suspicious of Walt's strange behavior.</p></div></button><button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; background: none; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; transition: background 0.15s; box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(30, 30, 30); position: relative;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vlgGfjtuO2WSLT7qYDVlvTpSVW.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; object-fit: cover; color: transparent; transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\"></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; padding-top: 2px;\"><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px 0px 4px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;\">S1 E3 • 49m</p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 5px; line-height: 1.3; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">...And the Bag's in the River</p><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); font-size: 12px; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.55; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Walter fights with Jesse over his drug use, causing him to leave Walter alone with their captive, Krazy-8. Meanwhile, Hank has a scared straight moment with Walter Jr. after his aunt discovers he has been smoking pot. Also, Skylar is upset when Walter stays away from home.</p></div></button><button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; background: none; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; transition: background 0.15s; box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(30, 30, 30); position: relative;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2UbRgW6apE4XPzhHPA726wUFyaR.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; object-fit: cover; color: transparent; transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\"></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; padding-top: 2px;\"><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px 0px 4px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;\">S1 E4 • 49m</p><p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px 0px 5px; line-height: 1.3; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Cancer Man</p><p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); font-size: 12px; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.55; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\">Walter finally tells his family that he has been stricken with cancer. Meanwhile, the DEA believes Albuquerque has a new, big time player to worry about. Meanwhile, a worthy recipient is the target of a depressed Walter's anger, and Jesse makes a surprise visit to his parents home.</p></div></button><button style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; background: none; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font-family: inherit; transition: background 0.15s; box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(30, 30, 30); position: relative;\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/82G3wZgEvZLKcte6yoZJahUWBtx.jpg\" style=\"position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; inset: 0px; object-fit: cover; color: transparent; transform: scale(1); transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);\"></div><div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; padding-top: 2px;\"><p style=\"color: rgba(25